            "review_title": "Review at Sura Sushi",
            "review_text": "hiepnv\nMinneapolis, Minnesota25 contributions\n0\nKorean - Japanese restaurant\nApr 2016 • Friends\nGreat location, great food, seem to have great customer service but not really.\n\n+ Location: although the address is No 2, Lot 2C, it's easy to find. It has 2 floor, 1st floor for common dinning area and 2nd floor for private dinning. Each private room can have 6-8 guest.\n\n+ Food: I feel the food here is fresher than other Japanese restaurant I have tried. \n\n+ Customer service: in general are good. They greeted us at door, bring us to the the room, seem nice. But they lack training, and didn't work well together. I ordered juice but they forgot, my friend asked to have beef without any sauces that has sugar, they said the staff order don't tell them about that. \n\nSomething I'm not sure:\nSeem that not much people know this place. I came here for lunch, only see 3 other people at the 1st floor and none on the 2nd floor (private room area)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 9, 2016",
